# Upload filter for `railway up`. Railway's CLI does NOT read .gitignore or
# .dockerignore, so the local .venv/ (810 MB) would otherwise be swept into
# the build context and blow the ~200 MB upload limit (Cloudflare 413).
#
# ThetaTerminalv3.jar (11 MB) is deliberately NOT ignored — the Dockerfile
# COPYs it into the image so the build stays hermetic.
.venv/
node_modules/
dist/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
.mypy_cache/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/
*.egg-info
.env
.env.*
tests/
test-ws.mjs
